1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,642
An octopus has three hearts.

2
00:00:01,662 --> 00:00:02,577
Two of them sit next

3
00:00:02,577 --> 00:00:03,192
to the gills,

4
00:00:03,212 --> 00:00:04,189
and push blood through them

5
00:00:04,189 --> 00:00:05,226
to pick up oxygen.

6
00:00:05,246 --> 00:00:06,788
Like two booster pumps.

7
00:00:06,808 --> 00:00:08,098
The third, the main heart,

8
00:00:08,118 --> 00:00:09,376
pumps that fresh blood around

9
00:00:09,376 --> 00:00:10,465
the rest of the body.

10
00:00:10,485 --> 00:00:11,214
And the blood?

11
00:00:11,234 --> 00:00:11,784
It's blue,

12
00:00:11,804 --> 00:00:13,254
thanks to hemocyanin,

13
00:00:13,274 --> 00:00:14,838
a protein built around copper.

14
00:00:14,858 --> 00:00:15,742
Count them again:

15
00:00:15,762 --> 00:00:16,645
one, two, three.
